---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

---

<Layout>
	
    
    <main class="w-full pt-28 bg-surface"><div class="flex flex-col w-full">
<section class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin py-8 md:py-16 w-full">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-start">
<div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col space-y-6">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 self-start px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary"></span>
<span class="">Oficio, Precisión &amp; Cuidado de Hogares</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-display-hero text-headline-lg md:text-display-hero text-primary tracking-tight">
          Hola, soy Liam O'Connell — <span class="text-secondary font-display-hero">Maestro pintor</span> y apasionado del detalle arquitectónico.
        </h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Pintor profesional con más de 12 años transformando hogares con pulcritud, materiales ecológicos y trato directo sin intermediarios.</p>
<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-start">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">home_repair_service</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-1.5">
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Mi filosofía artesanal</h3>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Protección hermética de suelos y zócalos, lijado sin polvo y pinturas premium ecológicas sin olor para tu total tranquilidad.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 pt-2">
<div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex flex-col">
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">+350</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Casas pintadas</span>
</div>
<div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex flex-col">
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">12</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Años de oficio</span>
</div>
<div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex flex-col">
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-secondary font-bold tracking-tight">100%</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Clientes satisfechos</span>
</div>
<div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex flex-col">
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold tracking-tight">0</span>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Quejas de limpieza</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-6 lg:pl-6">
<div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl bg-surface-container-high group">
<img class="w-full h-[460px] object-cover object-center group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700" data-alt="Close up warm professional portrait of master painter Liam O'Connell, wearing clean slate work clothes, holding a high-precision architectural paint swatch booklet in a sunlit modern renovated Madrid apartment with warm linen tones and pristine white plaster finishes" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AEtjO1XQ5vtVvA9zMSM3vQcHC0P0J5X1fwpUhFalHAc8zI81cSdfUtTETaz2a5f9y-4cmgvvxWRPy6lghjWnT3Rurh4UYKxhgUDYFM8aqli2EmyyZZQgO05kOKhsEcMtkm3lUvN4VLhYS1bQV5ZgijW8746moihuuLtMzghOU3hEDrIl8257fHNDHyxKBb6YjAwIIMot1h-o-FwJV5Qg1wWGbO_G_cPlK8SbTUop8M3B86nMXcC1_TP4h7ZnjxDx">
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-primary/80 via-primary/20 to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-6 text-on-primary">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-fixed text-[20px]">verified</span>
<span class="font-label-lg text-label-lg font-semibold tracking-wide">Liam O'Connell</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-primary-fixed opacity-95">
              Pintor Certificado • Especialista en Acabados y Microtexturas
            </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-secondary/15 text-secondary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">verified_user</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary">Compromiso Directo</p>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Sin intermediarios ni subcontratas de terceros</p>
</div>
</div>
<a class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label-sm text-label-sm hover:bg-primary transition-colors shrink-0" href="#contacto-personal">
            Contactar
          </a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="w-full bg-surface-container-low py-16">
<div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-12 gap-4">
<div class="space-y-2 max-w-xl">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">tune</span>
            Rigor &amp; Proceso
          </div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight">
            Mi Método de Trabajo Paso a Paso
          </h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
            Un sistema probado que garantiza una ejecución impecable, cero estrés para los propietarios y plazos de entrega respetados con total transparencia.
          </p>
</div>
<div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-2 text-on-surface-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-tertiary-fixed-dim"></span>
<span class="">Protocolo Estándar ISO de Calidad Residencial</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-surface-container rounded-bl-full -mr-6 -mt-6 pointer-events-none transition-colors group-hover:bg-secondary/10"></div>
<div>
<span class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-outline-variant font-bold block mb-4">01</span>
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">palette</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">Asesoría &amp; Diagnóstico</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Estudio de luz, recomendación de color y presupuesto cerrado en 24h sin compromiso.</p>
</div>
<div class="pt-6 mt-6 bg-surface-container/30 -mx-6 -mb-6 px-6 py-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">check</span>
<span class="">Muestras reales en pared</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-surface-container rounded-bl-full -mr-6 -mt-6 pointer-events-none transition-colors group-hover:bg-secondary/10"></div>
<div>
<span class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-outline-variant font-bold block mb-4">02</span>
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">layers</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">Preparación Rigurosa</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Encintado milimétrico, reparación de grietas y lijado conectado a aspiración sin polvo.</p>
</div>
<div class="pt-6 mt-6 bg-surface-container/30 -mx-6 -mb-6 px-6 py-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">check</span>
<span class="">Ambiente 100% libre de polvo</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-surface-container rounded-bl-full -mr-6 -mt-6 pointer-events-none transition-colors group-hover:bg-secondary/10"></div>
<div>
<span class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-outline-variant font-bold block mb-4">03</span>
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">format_paint</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">Aplicación de Élite</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Capas uniformes cruzadas con rodillo de pelo corto o airless para acabado liso perfecto.</p>
</div>
<div class="pt-6 mt-6 bg-surface-container/30 -mx-6 -mb-6 px-6 py-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">check</span>
<span class="">Uniformidad sin marcas</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-24 h-24 bg-surface-container rounded-bl-full -mr-6 -mt-6 pointer-events-none transition-colors group-hover:bg-secondary/10"></div>
<div>
<span class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-outline-variant font-bold block mb-4">04</span>
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-4">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">cleaning_services</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-2">Revisión &amp; Limpieza</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Limpieza exhaustiva y revisión conjunta bajo luz rasante antes de dar por cerrado el trabajo.</p>
</div>
<div class="pt-6 mt-6 bg-surface-container/30 -mx-6 -mb-6 px-6 py-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-secondary">check</span>
<span class="">Entrega reluciente</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin py-16 w-full">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
<div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">verified</span>
          Seguridad &amp; Respaldos
        </div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-primary tracking-tight">
          Pintor Homologado con Garantías Reales
        </h2>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
          Tu hogar es tu patrimonio más valioso. No dejo nada al azar: trabajo con credenciales oficiales, cobertura asegurada ante cualquier imprevisto y un compromiso legal de durabilidad.
        </p>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">badge</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-1">Pintor Homologado</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Acreditación oficial en revestimientos de alta decoración y acabados técnicos.</p>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-semibold">Registro Oficial Activo</span>
</div>
<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">security</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-1">Seguro RC Activo</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Póliza integral de hasta 300.000€ que protege tu vivienda ante cualquier imprevisto.</p>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-semibold">100% Asegurado</span>
</div>
<div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low shadow-sm flex flex-col items-start gap-4">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-highest text-primary flex items-center justify-center">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">workspace_premium</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary mb-1">Garantía de 2 Años</h3>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Certificado legal por escrito contra desconchados, ampollas y pérdida de tono.</p>
</div>
<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-semibold">Respaldo por Escrito</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-margin-mobile md:px-margin pb-16 w-full" id="contacto-personal">
<div class="p-8 md:p-12 rounded-xl bg-primary text-on-primary shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-surface-tint/10 pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-primary-container text-tertiary-fixed font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">ring_volume</span>
<span class="">Atención Personal • Sin Secretarias ni Bots</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-primary tracking-tight">
            Para mí, el trato directo es fundamental
          </h2>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary-fixed-dim leading-relaxed">Llámame o escríbeme directamente por WhatsApp. Te respondo personalmente hoy mismo para resolver tus dudas o agendar una visita rápida.</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 pt-2 font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-primary-container">
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-fixed text-[18px]">check</span>
              Respuesta en menos de 2 horas
            </span>
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-fixed text-[18px]">check</span>
              Presupuesto cerrado sin sorpresas
            </span>
<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-fixed text-[18px]">check</span>
              Disponibilidad inmediata
            </span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-4 p-6 rounded-xl bg-primary-container/80 shadow-inner backdrop-blur-sm">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#25D366]/20 text-[#25D366] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]">chat</span>
</div>
<div>
<p class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary-fixed">Mi Teléfono Personal</p>
<p class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-primary font-bold tracking-normal">+34 612 345 678</p>
</div>
</div>
<a class="w-full py-3.5 px-6 rounded-lg bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#1EBE5D] text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(37,211,102,0.3)] hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all" href="https://wa.me/34612345678?text=Hola%20Liam%2C%20le%C3%AD%20tu%20perfil%20en%20PintoresPro%20y%20me%20gustar%C3%ADa%20pedirte%20presupuesto%20para%20pintar%20mi%20casa." rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]">chat</span>
<span class="">Hablar con Liam por WhatsApp</span>
</a>
<p class="text-center font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-primary-container">
            Atención los 7 días de la semana de 08:00 a 21:00
          </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div></main><div class="fixed bottom-6 right-6 z-50 flex items-center group"><div class="mr-3 hidden md:flex items-center bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg shadow-[0_4px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] font-label-sm text-label-sm transition-all opacity-95 group-hover:opacity-100">¿Necesitas pintar tu casa? ¡Hablemos por WhatsApp!</div><a aria-label="Contacto directo por WhatsApp" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#25D366] text-on-primary flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_12px_32px_-6px_rgba(27,36,44,0.18)] hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-[0_6px_20px_rgba(37,211,102,0.45)] transition-all" href="https://wa.me/34612345678?text=Hola%2C%20quisiera%20pedir%20presupuesto%20para%20pintar%20mi%20vivienda" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[30px]">chat</span></a></div>

</Layout>
